[h1]Cosmic War[/h1]
[i]The definitive diplomatic warfare, mercenary, and conquest expansion for the Cosmic Series.[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]⚠️ CRITICAL: NEW SAVE FILE HARD REQUIRED ⚠️[/h2]
[b]The massive [THE ASCENSION ERA] update has completely overhauled the internal architecture of the Cosmic Series.[/b]
Attempting to load an existing save will cause severe corruption and crashes due to the massive structural changes. You [b]MUST[/b] start a new galaxy to play!

[hr][/hr]

[h2]What is Cosmic War?[/h2]
Bring total war to the galaxy! [b]Cosmic War[/b] transforms static NPC empires into aggressive, expanding juggernauts. Watch as factions build up War Heat, declare devastating wars, lay siege to fortified sectors, and offer you lucrative contracts to shift the balance of power. Every action you take has diplomatic consequences.

[b]⚠️ REQUIRED DEPENDENCY:[/b] Cosmic War is part of the "Core 5" Cosmic Series mods which are hard dependencies for each other. You [b]must[/b] be subscribed to all [b]REQUIRED ITEMS[/b] to play!

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Core Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]🔥 [b]Dynamic War Heat & Subspace Tears:[/b] Watch tensions rise. At critical levels, factions detonate experimental Subspace Weapons, tearing the fabric of space and unleashing localized Rifts!
[*]🛡️ [b]Frontline Sieges & Dreadnoughts:[/b] Factions dynamically siege enemy territory. Invasions perfectly scale to 100% of the defender's strength, spearheaded by massive Siege Dreadnoughts with 5x shield multipliers!
[*]⚡ [b]Electronic Warfare & Weather Sieges:[/b] Invaders have a 50% chance to EMP burst ALL shields to 0. Sieges under Dark Matter Fog slice defender boarding resistance in half!
[*]🏰 [b]Planetary Defense Grids:[/b] Sectors with Planetary Shields render all stations 100% invincible until the shield generator is destroyed!
[*]🌍 [b]Dynamic Territory Expansion:[/b] Factions physically conquer stations with AI Troop Transports and permanently expand their borders on the Galaxy Map!
[*]💰 [b]Mercenary Enlistment & War Contracts:[/b] Take on dynamically scaling combat missions based on War Heat (e.g. Force Recon, Subspace Containment, Supply Raids, Decapitation Strikes).
[*]🎭 [b]9 Dynamic Faction Traits:[/b] Factions are generated with traits like 'Entrenched' or 'Imperialist' (The Eclipse is hardcoded Imperialist!), altering their AI aggressiveness and mercenary payouts.
[*]🤝 [b]Alliance PvP Mirroring:[/b] Triggering a diplomatic incident spreads consequences permanently to your entire Player Alliance.
[*]📉 [b]Deep Economy Warfare:[/b] Market collapses natively trigger desperation invasions! Factions with severe Famine Scores launch massive assaults on wealthy neighbors to survive.
[*]📊 [b]Galactic Politics Tab:[/b] A real-time UI ledger of all active AI wars, ceasefires, and border skirmishes. Sort by War Heat, filter active Bounties, and view deep espionage profiles!
[*]🧠 [b]Identity-Driven AI & Bounties:[/b] Factions place bounties on rivals. The Mercantile trait pays 3x standard rates for mercenary contracts!
[*]📈 [b]Persistent Diplomacy Drift & Sanctions:[/b] Political relationships evolve in the background. Deep rivalries trigger trade sanctions.
[*]🕊️ [b]Ceasefire & Détente:[/b] Conflict cycles de-escalate as factions exhaust resources, resulting in fragile peace periods. Vengeful factions will NEVER accept ceasefires!
[*]📰 [b]War News & Broadcasts:[/b] Periodic war bulletins, propaganda beacons, and breaking news updates are broadcast server-wide!
[*]⚙️ [b]Cosmic Overhaul Synergy:[/b] Captain prediction overlays adapt dynamically to "War Heat", forcing fleets to route around dangerous frontlines!
[/list]

